contentText:
MGK would like a word with whoever posed as him on X recently to share a claim that he&#8217;s forever beating himself up about &#8220;fumbling&#8221; his relationship with ex Megan Fox . Actually he has nine words for that alleged mythmaker: &#8220; that tweet is faker than a pair of t&#8211;s .&#8221;

