That&#8217;s what the rapper (born Colson Baker) posted on X on Tuesday (Oct. 12) alongside a screenshot of the offending, seemingly fabricated post he said had nothing to do with him or his real feelings. The message posted from what appears to be the 36-year-old musician&#8217;s previous X account featured an old picture of him with Fox alongside some thirst trap snaps of the 40-year-old model/actress and a note that got MGK riled up.

&#8220;Seeing these new pictures of Megan genuinely makes me wanna throw my phone into a f**king wall,&#8221; it read. &#8220;i had the baddest woman to ever walk this planet in love with me and somehow found a way to f**k it all up. imagine fumbling the girl of your dreams and then having to watch the entire world remind you how beautiful she is. i&#8217;ll never forgive myself for that sh*t.&#8221;

A Community Note on the original post said that it &#8220;fabricates an X post from @machinegunkelly regretting losing Megan Fox. No such post exists from this his verified account.&#8221;

The former couple welcomed their first child together, daughter Saga Blade, in March 2025, reportedly three months after they split. They first met in 2020 on the set of the drama Midnight in the Switchgrass , and by July of that year they gave their first joint interview and talked about their on-set meet-cute. Shortly after that, they went Instagram official and made their red carpet debut that November. A year after getting engaged in January 2022, they were battling breakup rumors, with Fox confirming in March 2024 that their engagement was off. The Jennifer&#8217;s Body star revealed her pregnancy in November 2024, just weeks before their reported split.

While to date neither has gone into specific detail about the end of the affair, MGK has kept Fox in his heart — or a bit lower — in his comments on Fox&#8217;s posts. In March of this year, the rapper/rocker left an enthusiastic comment on one of Fox&#8217;s lusty photos, writing, &#8220; stoked we had a baby ,&#8221; alongside images of his ex sticking out her tongue and crawling on all fours in a body-hugging dress with an exposed thong. A week earlier, MGK appeared smitten by what looked like some other pics from that steamy shoot, writing, &#8220;stoked i have your phone number.&#8221;
